OL,3,AUK in talks with EU partners over fuel
OL,4,Areserves after Trump diesel threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritain is in talks with EU partners to
OL,7,Frelease additional strategic fuel
OL,8,Freserves, including diesel, if needed,
OL,9,Fthe BBC understands.
OL,11,FThe talks come after President Donald
OL,12,FTrump threatened to ban diesel exports
OL,13,Ffrom the US in a bid to reduce record
OL,14,Fprices at the pumps for Americans.
OL,16,FDiesel prices in the UK also hit record
OL,17,Fhighs this week and are hovering just
OL,18,Funder 200p per litre, according to
OL,19,Fmotoring organisation the RAC.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
