OL,3,AUK in talks with EU partners over fuel
OL,4,Areserves after Trump diesel threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US is a vital supplier of diesel to
OL,7,Fthe world, exporting between 1.2 and
OL,8,F1.5 million barrels per day, with
OL,9,Fexperts warning a ban on shipments
OL,10,Fabroad could put further pressure on
OL,11,Fprices in other countries.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
